### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "chunkylover23",
    "email": "chunky@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Register another user (for testing ownership)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "anotheruser",
    "email": "another@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Try to register with missing fields (should get 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser"
}

### Try to register duplicate username (should get 409)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "chunkylover23",
    "email": "duplicate@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login with correct credentials (save the token from response)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "chunkylover23",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login with wrong password (should get 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "chunkylover23",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Login with non-existent user (should get 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "nonexistent",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Get all images (should fail - 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images

### Get all images with token (replace TOKEN with actual token from login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/images
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImNodW5reWxvdmVyMjMiLCJpYXQiOjE3MTU5MzIyNDUsImV4cCI6MTcxNjAxODY0NX0.6Q8qXQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQ

