### Rename image (success - if owned by chunkylover23)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/images/69adc72668dd63050662093d
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImNodW5reWxvdmVyMjMiLCJpYXQiOjE3MTU5MzIyNDUsImV4cCI6MTcxNjAxODY0NX0.6Q8qXQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQmQ
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "New Image Name"
}

### Rename image (try to rename without token - should get 401)
